                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi></head>
                <p>The information given here as to the meeting and the participants is taken from
                    the Log, <hi rendition="#italic">ante</hi>, <ref target="#pg295">p. 295</ref>.
                    No record of the subjects discussed <pb facs="0416" n="316" xml:id="pg316"/> at
                    this meeting has been found. See, however, the editorial note on the
                    Roosevelt–Churchill dinner meeting, <hi rendition="#italic">ante</hi>, <ref
                        target="#pg307">p. 307</ref>.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
